# work/ IS versioned (process artifacts are the resumable memory of each task —
# same model as psyco-api's feature workspaces). What stays OUT:
#
# - per-machine pointers and HUMAN SIGNATURES: committing a signature would open
#   a gate on somebody else's clone that their user never approved
work/_active
work/_PROCESS-CHANGE-OK
work/*/PUSH-APPROVED
work/*/HUMAN-GATE-OK
# - anything dumped from the ticket or captured as raw evidence: it routinely
#   contains client data / test-user credentials pasted into comments. The
#   authored artifacts (intake, matrices, plan, verdicts, delivery-state) must
#   never contain credentials (Phase 0 §0.0.3) — that is what makes them safe
#   to version.
work/*/attachments/
work/*/jira_tickets/

.DS_Store
